SUMMARY:Yoga In Nature™\, SUP Yoga\, Lake Wheeler
DESCRIPTION:Yoga In Nature™\, NC\n**ANOTHER SUP YOGA CLASS!!! Grab your 
 Standup Paddle Board and meet us at Lake Wheeler (or rent one there from W
 ake Rack OR rent my extra board). ALL LEVELS (including first-timers). $40
  payment due at signup**\, **in order to hold your spot\, due to limited 8
  spots available.** At least 3 attendees to run this class.\nPayment by Ve
 nmo @Darlene-Genander (0862 if asked)\; Paypal dgenander@yogainnature.com\
 ; OR Zelle\n\n**$40/person** includes basic paddle instruction\, water saf
 ety\, yoga class on SUP\, anchors (to borrow for class). \\*If it rains an
 d I have to cancel\, you will be reimbursed. If you sign up and can’t ma
 ke it\, you will receive a one time credit for a future SUP Yoga class to 
 use this season.\\*NOTE THAT THIS CLASS IS ALSO BEING POSTED IN YOGA IN NA
 TURE\, SUP YOGA\, AND YOU ONLY NEED TO SIGN UP ONCE. LIMITED TO 8 ATTENDEE
 S.\nCertified SUP yoga instructor to lead you in yoga\, on the water:)\n\n
 I have one board for rent\, first come first serve ($25). There may be boa
 rds to rent at Lake Wheeler from Wake Rack on a first come\, first serve b
 asis (by the hour\, so you need to rent for 2 hours)\, but contact them di
 rectly. I will have anchors to borrow\, if you need one\, for anchoring do
 wn to do the yoga practice:) Check in advance about the rentals as they go
  quickly and often sell out.\nRentals at https://wakerack.com/\nWe will me
 et at the far boat ramp and begin with basic instruction of the paddle str
 okes\, board\, anchor\, etc. If you have already done SUP\, you can get ou
 t on the water and we will meet you there after 15 minutes of intro and ho
 w to get on board from dock. We will paddle out to one of the coves (15 - 
 20 minutes) then anchor down for about a 60 minute SUP yoga class. Then\, 
 we will paddle back in unless you choose to remain on the water to explore
 .\nPlease bring your board\; paddle\; anchor (or I have 6 to lend out)\; w
 ater bottle\; sunscreen\, etc\; ***Good Pops will be provided\, to enjoy a
 fter class:)***\nALL Levels welcome. $40 pay in advance by Venmo @Darlene-
 Genander (0862 last 4 digits of phone if asked) or PayPal at dgenander@yog
 ainnature.com to hold your spot.\nIF IT RAINS OR IF I NEED TO CANCEL\, I W
 ILL REFUND YOUR $40.
